{"created": "2020-02-21T05:49:33.708910+00:00", "modified": "2023-03-02T09:53:04.099650+00:00", "id": 3677685, "conceptrecid": "3227659", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.3677685", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.3227659", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3677685", "metadata": {"title": "Computation-Ready Experimental Metal-Organic Framework (CoRE MOF) 2019 Dataset", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.3677685", "publication_date": "2020-02-21", "description": "<p>High-throughput computational screening of metal-organic frameworks rely on the availability of<strong><em>&nbsp;</em></strong>atomic coordinate files which can be used as input to simulation software packages. CoRE MOF Datasets are derived from Cambridge Structural Database (CSD) and also from the World Wide Web.</p>\n\n<p>This research is supported by the U.S. Department of Energy, Office of Basic Energy Sciences, Division of Chemical Sciences, Geosciences and&nbsp;Biosciences under Award DE-FG02-17ER16362 (Predictive Hierarchical&nbsp;Modeling of Chemical Separations and Transformations in Functional&nbsp;Nanoporous Materials: Synergy of Electronic Structure Theory, Molecular&nbsp;Simulations, Machine Learning, and Experiment).</p>\n\n<p><strong>- Please report any errors that you have found from the dataset by filling out <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSehOpqzvbRbIzF3FuYK1NyiGqy-L-_kC7nIf3kCjNW3LV10uw/viewform\">this</a> form!<br>\n- For bulk submission, send an email to drygchung(at)gmail.com</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>Nomenclatures:</strong></p>\n\n<p>LCD (Largest Cavity Diameter), PLD (pore limiting diameter), LFPD (Largest Sphere along the Free Path), ASA (Accessible Surface Area), NASA (Non-accessible surface area), AV_VF (Void Fraction, 0 - 1), NAV (Non Accessible Volume)</p>\n\n<p><strong>February, 21 2020</strong></p>\n\n<p>- Unmodified filenames are available in ASR-full_unmodified.csv and FSR-full_unmodified.csv</p>\n\n<p><strong>November, 4 2019</strong></p>\n\n<p>- Added a spreadsheet for the full internal version of ASR datasets (<em>N</em> = 14,142).</p>\n\n<p>- Moved additional&nbsp;disordered structures to disorder folder (thanks to Matthew Witman and Martin Hutereau)</p>\n\n<p><strong>August, 17 2019</strong></p>\n\n<p>-&nbsp;FIJDOS_freeONLY has been corrected.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Yongchul G. Chung", "affiliation": "Pusan National University"}, {"name": "Emmanuel Haldoupis", "affiliation": "University of Minnesota Twin Cities"}, {"name": "Benjamin J. Bucior", "affiliation": "Northwestern University"}, {"name": "Maciej Haranczyk", "affiliation": "IMDEA"}, {"name": "Seulchan Lee", "affiliation": "Pusan National University"}, {"name": "Konstantinos D. Vogiatzis", "affiliation": "University of Minnesota Twin Cities"}, {"name": "Sanliang Ling", "affiliation": "University of Nottingham"}, {"name": "Marija Milisavljevic", "affiliation": "Georgia Institute of Technology"}, {"name": "Hongda Zhang", "affiliation": "Northwestern University"}, {"name": "Jeff S. Camp", "affiliation": "Georgia Institute of Technology"}, {"name": "Ben Slater", "affiliation": "University College London"}, {"name": "J. Ilja Siepmann", "affiliation": "University of Minnesota Twin Cities"}, {"name": "David S. Sholl", "affiliation": "Georgia Institute of Technology"}, {"name": "Randall Q. Snurr", "affiliation": "Northwestern University"}], "keywords": ["metal-organic frameworks", "computation-ready", "experimental", "nanoporous materials"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.1021/acs.chemmater.5b03836", "relation": "isSupplementedBy", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.1021/acs.chemmater.6b04226", "relation": "isSupplementedBy", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.3228673", "relation": "isNewVersionOf", "scheme": "doi"}], "version": "1.1.3", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "communities": [{"id": "core-mofs"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 4, "is_last": false,